  "purpose": "本轮新生成代表基础音色；待用户听审",
  "sources": [
    {
      "text": "您昨天都陪他走了一路啦。今天让他早些到家，您也少站一会儿。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
        "scene_id": "s001",
        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b008"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "阿蘅"
    },
    {
      "text": "留着下回唱给你。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
        "scene_id": "s001",
        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b013"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "阿蘅"
    },
    {
      "text": "所以你得听全，少一句都不许跑。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
        "scene_id": "s001",
        "block_ids": [
          "screenplay-04-lantern-home-s001-b016"
        ]
      },
      "original_speaker": "阿蘅"
    },
    {
      "text": "这回不省。您放心。",
      "source": {
        "object_id": "screenplay-04-lantern-home-e01",
        "revision_id": "8148732c492764da35ae228d6ba7613ae8108fb121aa30802088165721e3013e",
